  Don't hand-roll one unless you need to — &#x2A;*`@stitchapi/redis`** is the
  first-party store: `redisStore(fromIoredis(client))` (or `fromNodeRedis`),
  proven against the `verifyStoreContract` conformance kit.
</Callout>

